<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Sowa Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Sowa Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    51.81		vs	   71.10</p>
<p> Operating	    4.46		vs	   14.43</p>
<p> Current	    806    million    vs	    3.89</p>
<p> Net		  822    million    vs	  663    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.01 yen	  vs	    3.24 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    205 million	  vs	 205 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  1.25 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyo Sowa Bank Ltd is a regional bank operating in the Tokyo metropolitan area.</p>
